<t name="Offerings" t-name="website.judge_exciting">
    <t t-call="website.layout">
        <div id="wrap" class="oe_structure">
        <header style="padding:clamp(3.5rem,9vw,6.5rem) clamp(1.5rem,6vw,6rem) clamp(1.75rem,4vw,2.75rem);">
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:var(--text-label);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label);font-weight:var(--weight-medium);color:var(--vermilion);margin-bottom:20px;">
                <span style="color:var(--ink-faint);font-weight:var(--weight-regular);">03</span>
                <span>Offerings</span>
                <span style="flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--line);min-width:24px;"/>
            </div>
            <h1 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:var(--weight-regular);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink);font-size:clamp(2.75rem,8vw,6rem);line-height:var(--leading-tight);letter-spacing:-0.005em;margin:0;max-width:18ch;">from the heart.</h1>
            <p style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(1.125rem,2.4vw,1.5rem);line-height:1.4;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:22px 0 0;max-width:40rem;">I love to learn about what gets people excited. Let me help you share what gets you pumped.</p>
        </header>
        <section style="padding:clamp(4rem,10vw,7rem) clamp(1.5rem,6vw,6rem);border-top:1px solid var(--line);" class="o_colored_level">
            <div style="max-width:72rem;margin:0 auto;">
                <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:clamp(1rem,2vw,1.5rem);">
                <div style="background:var(--surface-card);border:none;border-top:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:0;padding:var(--space-6);"><div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;"><span style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:12px;color:var(--vermilion);">01</span><h3 style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:clamp(1.375rem,2.4vw,1.625rem);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.01em;line-height:1.15;margin:0;color:var(--ink);">Eulogies &amp;amp; Memorials</h3></div><p style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:14px 0 0;">We are all survived by the&amp;nbsp;memories others have of us, whether we're here&amp;nbsp;or not. I can help you find the joy that came before the final milestone and shape the memories survivors hold in their hearts.&amp;nbsp;</p></div>
                <div style="background:var(--surface-card);border:none;border-top:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:0;padding:var(--space-6);"><div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;"><span style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:12px;color:var(--vermilion);">02</span><h3 style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:clamp(1.375rem,2.4vw,1.625rem);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.01em;line-height:1.15;margin:0;color:var(--ink);">Celebration Speeches</h3></div><p style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:14px 0 0;">Weddings, anniversaries, milestone birthdays — the toast that sounds like you on your best day. Funny where it should be, sincere where it counts, short enough to keep the room.</p></div>
                <div style="background:var(--surface-card);border:none;border-top:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:0;padding:var(--space-6);"><div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;"><span style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:12px;color:var(--vermilion);">03</span><h3 style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:clamp(1.375rem,2.4vw,1.625rem);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.01em;line-height:1.15;margin:0;color:var(--ink);">Professional Tributes</h3></div><p style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:14px 0 0;">Retirements, award introductions, colleague send-offs. Thirty years of work deserves more than a sheet cake and “good luck.” I turn a career into a story people actually want to hear.</p></div>
                <div style="background:var(--surface-card);border:none;border-top:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:0;padding:var(--space-6);"><div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;"><span style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:12px;color:var(--vermilion);">04</span><h3 style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:clamp(1.375rem,2.4vw,1.625rem);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.01em;line-height:1.15;margin:0;color:var(--ink);">Written Keepsakes</h3></div><p style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:14px 0 0;">Not everything needs a podium. Letters for milestone moments, printed tribute pieces, memorials for pets who were family. Written to be handed over, folded up, and kept.</p></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section style="padding:clamp(4rem,10vw,7rem) clamp(1.5rem,6vw,6rem);border-top:1px solid var(--line);" class="o_colored_level">
            <div style="max-width:72rem;margin:0 auto;">
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:var(--text-label);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label);font-weight:var(--weight-medium);color:var(--text-accent);margin-bottom:28px;">
                    <span style="color:var(--ink-faint);font-weight:var(--weight-regular);">How it works</span>
                    <span style="flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--line);min-width:24px;"/>
                </div>
                <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:3rem 1fr;gap:18px;padding:26px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);align-items:baseline;"><span style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1rem;color:var(--vermilion);">01</span><div><h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:var(--weight-regular);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink);font-size:clamp(1.125rem,2vw,1.375rem);line-height:1.1;margin:0;">Book a consultation</h3><p style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:10px 0 0;max-width:44rem;">Find time to have a conversation, we'll start with 30 minutes, establish how much there is to say, and make a plan.&amp;nbsp;</p></div></div>
                <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:3rem 1fr;gap:18px;padding:26px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);align-items:baseline;"><span style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1rem;color:var(--vermilion);">02</span><div><h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:var(--weight-regular);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink);font-size:clamp(1.125rem,2vw,1.375rem);line-height:1.1;margin:0;">I listen</h3><p style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:10px 0 0;max-width:44rem;">You tell me what you want, I'll make sure you're comfortable. I can talk to one or many, in person, on phone, or video.</p></div></div>
                <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:3rem 1fr;gap:18px;padding:26px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);align-items:baseline;"><span style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1rem;color:var(--vermilion);">03</span><div><h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:var(--weight-regular);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink);font-size:clamp(1.125rem,2vw,1.375rem);line-height:1.1;margin:0;">Your work is private</h3><p style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:10px 0 0;max-width:44rem;">I'll write for you. Not AI, no peers, no judgement.</p></div></div>
                <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:3rem 1fr;gap:18px;padding:26px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);align-items:baseline;"><span style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1rem;color:var(--vermilion);">04</span><div><h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:var(--weight-regular);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink);font-size:clamp(1.125rem,2vw,1.375rem);line-height:1.1;margin:0;">it's yours</h3><p style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:10px 0 0;max-width:44rem;">Delivered in the medium of your choice.</p></div></div>
                <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:3rem 1fr;gap:18px;padding:26px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);align-items:baseline;"><span style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1rem;color:var(--vermilion);"><br/></span><div><h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:var(--weight-regular);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink);font-size:clamp(1.125rem,2vw,1.375rem);line-height:1.1;margin:0;"><br/></h3></div></div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section style="padding:clamp(3rem,7vw,5rem) clamp(1.5rem,6vw,6rem);border-top:1px solid var(--line);" class="o_colored_level">
            <div style="max-width:72rem;margin:0 auto;">
                <div style="border-left:2px solid var(--vermilion);padding-left:clamp(1.25rem,3vw,2rem);">
                    <p style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(1.125rem,2.2vw,1.375rem);line-height:1.45;color:var(--ink);margin:0;max-width:46rem;">Everything you tell me stays between us.&amp;nbsp;</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section style="padding:clamp(4rem,10vw,7rem) clamp(1.5rem,6vw,6rem);border-top:1px solid var(--line);" class="o_colored_level">
            <div style="max-width:72rem;margin:0 auto;">
                <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:var(--weight-regular);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink);font-size:clamp(2rem,5.5vw,3.75rem);line-height:var(--leading-tight);letter-spacing:-0.005em;margin:0;max-width:20ch;">Start with a conversation.</h2>
                <p style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:clamp(1.0625rem,2vw,1.25rem);line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:18px 0 0;max-width:44rem;">Let's talk.</p>
                <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:22px;margin-top:34px;">
                    <a href="/shop/tribute-consultation-7" style="display: inline-block; background: var(--vermilion); font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: var(--text-label); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); text-decoration: none; padding: 16px 28px; border-radius: 2px;"><font style="color: var(--paper);">Book the consult →</font></a>
                    <a href="/blog" style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: var(--text-label); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--vermilion); padding-bottom: 3px;"><font style="color: var(--ink);">Or read a few first</font></a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        </div>
    </t>
</t>
